            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "I was able to observe this issue once again and there is strange log message inside qTox:\n\nduring the call when this happens (the important is to emphasis this is during the call and not on call attempt):\n`user_name went offline during the call attempt`\nwhile clearly there was no call attempt but ongoing call.\n\nthis leads to hang-up sound was not played. Let us hope that this can help to narrow down where the issue may be.",
